  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a5b97e7206a1412f84c4d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最后，我祈祷。\r\n愿消除所有世界伤痛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7340b12d4b31f2720cb7caf6f7364113600239e6b07a715152565b9316f5eaa3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afde7abc112833c0bc7d05f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有活动任务喔～\r\n这里也得大扫除一番才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe11d64f81cb4cfbd048f7c21ed44f41581a87672cf68246a19a43109795cfe7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9de422d403934962044f8f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别忘记领取喔。\r\n差不多该从\r\n新年氛围中收心了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd16b3819eb07e97bbdaf42ed76fddbc06e087c6d3a90054438a5c08b2832f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f413912f8225ab902ba0ec41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4360444d6c656befc2f50400428191c7d309ea9f0d2f3196191c9929aa769ce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be0200cc202016bc1e39ac0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，治愈之力…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01fdf44f44eb081a04820da9a47b646cd87fbc6dff0f7a9e8ca08cd390a80b01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f94bb808829b8e74cb9bb66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈们即将踏上的道路，\r\n同时也是我曾经走过的道路。\r\n所以我懂她们的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "300d472133277df79beddef702157ec35aec4888fb1e66a41fa50cd4381888a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "400037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663655a5ce65326ae5963f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，治愈之力。\r\n集结于我的手中，上位·增益治疗！\r\n……那么，为胜利献上祝福吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1296a8b5d998ac2368533f00f4032639f6634591aeb414e224c585878596be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f2cc410f6ac0adeac7f13dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那两位一定没问题的。\r\n我们能做的，\r\n就只有相信并为她们加油而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8985475a69ab9f8f36af6e4e557baaf90f17c832389b14873a7184f30e600a0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "400040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f82a093e51cfc5b143f3077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たとえ眼前に高き山々がそびえようと――\r\n立つのはその、頂！\r\nはあああああ～～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2412c36e2040f1b2ad92adacfb417ee1a809a2763497d117c224f652cd4dbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "40005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e13ace5821a58e7b1003973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たとえ眼前に高き山々がそびえようと――\r\n立つのはその、頂！\r\nはあああああ～～～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2412c36e2040f1b2ad92adacfb417ee1a809a2763497d117c224f652cd4dbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "40006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4ea1f55fe5bcd381bb46e2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc382c3ca5ea02190458aa234f04aee233424221287a14f178a8eebeb513977d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4945bb80ff75e25e27fb35dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a130af1ae2f6c82946ec45e23fccdc80b2717aefb552f1129338be26f08bec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:384b429247ee00c2c0767bea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a21842da2da756d2638312d58df5cabcef4c00e2156cd5fcf55995c8af404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3111274daf1915309920bcd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a21842da2da756d2638312d58df5cabcef4c00e2156cd5fcf55995c8af404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c03d09bba097c0e59c0f5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f03b588ca5a5ba0a18727f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31e8467400489f213add8d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e39481150257f7ee9643f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa590602b03384649277b084cd36d881d4f24707abf056fd0a939443d6e5c4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
