      "source_text": "还请多多手下留情♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c60e9409dbce61e9a1791ce5f4ce22c398a6debff2e684d2dbd7556ea6fade4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b11e42063769aba544bac2e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次也请让我好好学点东西吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d8ebf96b9955cfac9cbf44fa9f4d925f0c01feea05c0dda6f13a3c5b8e8be1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b97231eb0de2237bc5fe29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。\r\n俗话说“早晨一小时抵得上晚间的两小时。”\r\n可要好好珍惜时间哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a81c50c1c1e36a1daf9df59b97b273e3cd0069f273ba83e5fc95cc5087bfbf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eef95acdf5a123c38b7d325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来一杯提神醒脑的早茶如何呢？\r\n正所谓“哪怕赶路七里，也要饮上一杯茶”。\r\n也能让人快速清醒哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddd8708cd0b6471656143a4f284a44f9e781ae337d4f0e1f0ad2c77091dbf413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1007f75cb5596acf08983ac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安。\r\n端整好仪容仪表，\r\n下午的训练也好好加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db5f693252df853075ffade3dcf28a803951bc9e717a1d253d13f8a2c351a82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6a6a3b9136f4f1f1ed2f4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近开始喜欢上做便当了呢。\r\n如果不嫌弃的话下次要尝尝看吗？\r\n我对味道还是很自信的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "77cf37c952faa9e63d45a6802524bbdf51e8f47c6bf6eba468ed83aa8d491f0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee9d3f95041564c6072cff89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，小鹰每次都跑过来\r\n戏弄我……啊，不不。\r\n什么事都没有哦～，呼呼呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa6302c6b09914ed9f567e452f585356984b66d5ede74d0e62d8bf93aca3ea8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ef6396f003888ebadf94b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可不要太勉强自己哦。\r\n不然可变成“晚睡晚起的夜猫子”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1db9a036b32401d5e1350b588ae391e29578f92f9db1e000a6f241f5cbc898",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60382c8f8bd6bdcd3a99e3a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花儿的笑容最能让人感觉到春天来了呢。\r\n要不要一起优哉游哉地散会步呢？\r\n一定会很清爽的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "111bd7362bc734fdcb2bcbc672aabefc14de26f0e1dd9d61941a9dd3eaaa2dda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6047560734d28c81e151e7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊。天气真是热呢～。\r\n要不要在地上撒些水呢。\r\n说不定能稍微凉快一些。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb2d7c0424f17598389cce6c32113e3673473610b8237aa7838518ea90221c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c4d01981d40998cd123c2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“秋天的太阳落得快”。\r\n对时间的感觉也因此变得敏锐了，\r\n能够好好地珍惜每一天了呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a758ac6c76e31194ce3a04e64cddc14e123bf2e61b0837c7ea9a3479cc083459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc4077c669f1fa79e34ae4d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“如果冬天来了，春天还会远吗。\r\n冬天的努力与春天的飞跃息息相关。\r\n就让我们打起精神地上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3de76da079285efbdfa073306d6ba1086d08755d1e510657af2150fffb325554",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82a56697b24ec3279470728a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼呼，训练员一脸很困的样子呢。\r\n要为你施展一下，让人清醒的魔法吗？\r\n那么就……我戳♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "362ef1801453a0998252f53801dfcb67258316662cbd06f83dedba5d308954cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806e335765b088aff4c05fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早在喝早茶的时候，茶梗立起来了呢。\r\n真是个预示着冒险顺利的好兆头呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13bbe490acbc362c7f5ed1c8937ee04d63dc14ff9a1fd68ff78f8289df88fb33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:668ab574758074a4183a5906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭有好好吃吗？\r\n“饿着肚子可冒不了险”哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7f1f199c14a8f3d9de0ac7030c2ffd7a3f0f0b6dff40d88fa2da6cb0cd0601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bbd5a9fac23570722f60c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起来一杯药草茶吗？\r\n时不时休息一下，\r\n对冒险来说也是很重要的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10576c84954b57a20423d1fb384d6ff13963cb2ca609caf6d39d8448eceba496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd4a3eb20fbfdc22a5e5e416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也有顺利地升级吗？\r\n我还打算再稍微训练一会儿……\r\n能和我一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca78d4f38e646283d16f0633eddf117a32e7cbd46a1b13ada1419e43ac801c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53f2a6191173b36e03f65247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也辛苦您了。\r\n如果需要被治愈的话，就用很甜～的和三盆糖\r\n来给心灵施展回复魔法吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a5c7f960af6606180ec2a3ad12d2104505e4c6dc98027f08a8ff61a7c68e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0daddcf824ad975e77494c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天，可是最适合开展新冒险的季节呢。\r\n要是都用来睡懒觉的话就太可惜了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "63c871e26b4e8c287883f871e3081d46ed3ab7b6988f59c52f3e3dc63640714a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24d5fca7b2059ad49a0b9a76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正炎热的日子还会这样继续……\r\n来点冷却魔法【恐怖故事】怎么样呢？\r\n能立刻就凉快下来哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ca08e930fe2fde11d36b09e6d642cc801ddc9350835aced52beaaf45e3a01c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e6c298ddd40135f69687bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是看着被红叶浸染的树木，\r\n心情就会平静下来……\r\n对于治愈师来说相性很好，什么的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9226360010f486e6e55dda3871b981ae91d3a9e033a34a3bc486b399ddd3ba3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fa5815911705f3575c1c33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有谁能反抗，\r\n被炉的魔力呢～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d19cde21496471644f2f88c42d779a62cd5809799df2e27895d6dfa38cf7452e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3587c79bebab7a2df8af32e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2aacb4e5aba517d420da5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c979a99a99b78ed0f7e18a3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小鹰居然会往纳豆里面加辣酱哦？\r\n这种唾弃传统的行为，\r\n我绝不能轻饶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0ae8e78933569de60f912ec4a132da97bd842fa3886519ad1775a3d6a035e24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420c09994930ff16d900acce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在美国的妹妹给我发电子邮件了。\r\n说什么“总有一天会赢过姐姐的！”\r\n什么的……很可爱对吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a1b76cf3dc9d5f5974f5278e16a8f4bf886e52e89a990d48dfb080f0bc2d0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e1dcfc6bc0aa547c07a72b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样堂堂正正地发起挑战的话，\r\n我不就只能堂堂正正地接受了吗。\r\n哼哼……小特真是的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "996c3607ad939d829dce39c68b8ff4f00f9d9e000bce52d14354fc261d9886cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143e0b865189fba9b65289e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是谁都能够照料得到……\r\n丸善小姐真是令人钦佩。\r\n可得报答这份恩情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f09ef0c40f22d8629ef29add7173ac7765d67c1f7dcbb5bafb57af823d2591c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb0ac0d75139ca9a0818d43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要急躁，悠～闲地冷静下来吧。\r\n越是忙的时候就越要放～松。\r\n做事最重要的就是平常心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ab79d7b612e2f1dcea05f96eb847f385be9b658b91a7b99dbb5dbb50e557d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9831e1373cdb826fa7a3c2dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是哪种舞步都放马过来哟～。\r\n这副日日精进舞蹈所锻炼出来的身体，\r\n敬请见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfdffe71014b0d000947ebd383c388018b2760a1473d9ba2043be43cf528faa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c612976a860bb4e08aa39e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下摆轻飘飘的，又很轻快……\r\n呵呵，简直就像在鱼缸中游动的金鱼一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "013b545c63af20d0d79e8ae7b4c60a7702094401a8bdc3a480b19890a4c066cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d521527fac967fab778fa75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然已经穿上了这件衣服的话……\r\n就不能在人前露出不像样的样子呢。\r\n嗯……绝对不会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0681b579e7007879f3ff6c2655ebe0758196ff3f33bd8ab9094892f4db1ccf8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b42dcc8c5db5109237552ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说青色是能让人静下心来的颜色……\r\n但青色也是比那赤红更为热烈燃烧着的，\r\n火焰的颜色呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3966bdf8d2bca592304a2c4e0a2611bbe01b5df1a37d5ed466dae38ca23ff9d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4394c83ac295e76be69c9011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也看到了吗？\r\n今天的朝阳是那么的美丽。\r\n这就是所谓的“别有趣味”吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "407cbba9108e9d8ed97c26091ee01e0d48a80c5a18bb721b488df61d7bff098e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
